{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
'''Group H of the [[2002 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 4 June 2002 to 14 June 2002. [[Japan national football team|Japan]] won the group and advanced to the round of 16 (for the first time ever), along with [[Belgium national football team|Belgium]]. [[Russia national football team|Russia]] and [[Tunisia national football team|Tunisia]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |last=Manaschev |first=Erlan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2002full.html |title=World Cup 2002 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=3 July 2008 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

